nal_003_s16","report_id":"final_003","text":"Figure 3 shows the test accuracy during training.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_003_s17","report_id":"final_003","text":"Ours outperforms ViT-S by 28.4 percentage points at epoch 24.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_003_s18","report_id":"final_003","text":"At epoch 18, ViT-S achieves 78.2% test accuracy.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_003_s19","report_id":"final_003","text":"On Fashion-MNIST, Random Forest obtains an accuracy of 92.7%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_003_s20","report_id":"final_003","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"}]}